# Build products of `Scripts/`, and the generated Xcode project. None of these
# is source and none may be committed.
#
#   Frameworks/        the staticlibs `Scripts/build-bridge.sh` stages — the
#                      universal archive and the two per-arch slices the budget
#                      gate measures. They are ~10 MB artifacts of this
#                      workspace, and a committed copy is a copy that can be
#                      stale.
#   TwinVPN.xcodeproj/ generated by `xcodegen generate` from project.yml.
#                      `project.yml`'s header is the argument for why the spec
#                      is the source.
Frameworks/
TwinVPN.xcodeproj/
